ms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A northern Kentucky family has rejected a $26 million offer for their generational farm, calling it “priceless.” The Huddlestons prioritize heritage and agricultural continuity over economic gain. While a proposed AI-linked data centre promises jobs and infrastructure investment, the family resists, citing long-term environmental and community impacts, highlighting the growing tension between technological development and preserving farmland for future generations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/family-says-no-to-26-million-offer-to-build-ai-data-center-on-their-priceless-generational-farm/articleshow/129869813.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/family-says-no-to-26-million-offer-to-build-ai-data-center-on-their-priceless-generational-farm/articleshow/129869813.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T23:54:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129870757,imgsize-897267.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why has Clavicular been arrested multiple times in 2026? A look at the past incidents]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129869815.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Clavicular has been arrested twice in 2026. His February arrest in Arizona included serious charges but was later dropped due to lack of evidence, as confirmed by The New York Times journalist Joseph Bernstein. His second arrest in March in Florida involved a battery charge linked to a livestream incident. He has since been released, and the case is still recent.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-has-clavicular-been-arrested-multiple-times-in-2026-a-look-at-the-past-incidents/articleshow/129869815.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/why-has-clavicular-been-arrested-multiple-times-in-2026-a-look-at-the-past-incidents/articleshow/129869815.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T23:17:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129869789,imgsize-20984.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[The GOAT tower: Why Illinois farmers built this 31-foot tower just for goats]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129868537.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A unique 31-foot brick tower in Windsor, Illinois, built for goats, has gained online attention.  Farmers David and Marcia Johnson created the 'Tower of Baa-Goat' to allow their animals to express natural climbing instincts.  This structure, originally conceived in the late 1990s, serves as a practical enrichment for the goats and a distinctive farm attraction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-goat-tower-why-illinois-farmers-built-this-31-foot-tower-just-for-goats/articleshow/129868537.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-goat-tower-why-illinois-farmers-built-this-31-foot-tower-just-for-goats/articleshow/129868537.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T22:22:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129868808,imgsize-636776.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Nerdeen Kiswani? Pro-Palestinian activist targeted in foiled assassination attempt in New York]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129867667.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-nerdeen-kiswani-pro-palestinian-activist-targeted-in-foiled-assassination-attempt-in-new-york/articleshow/129867667.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-nerdeen-kiswani-pro-palestinian-activist-targeted-in-foiled-assassination-attempt-in-new-york/articleshow/129867667.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T21:10:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129867667,imgsize-71856.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[JD Vance casts UFOs as ‘demons’ and vows to uncover government secrets on unexplained phenomena]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129866363.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[JD Vance has injected a provocative twist into the UFO debate, suggesting they could be “demons” rather than extraterrestrials. Framing the mystery through his religious worldview, he admits he hasn’t fully studied the evidence yet but is determined to dig into classified files, portraying himself as both deeply curious and intent on uncovering what the government really knows.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-casts-ufos-as-demons-and-vows-to-uncover-government-secrets-on-unexplained-phenomena/articleshow/129866363.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-casts-ufos-as-demons-and-vows-to-uncover-government-secrets-on-unexplained-phenomena/articleshow/129866363.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T20:45:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129867465,imgsize-788814.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Saudi pact becoming a problem for us': Why Pak wants to host US-Iran peace talks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129867059.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/saudi-pact-becoming-a-problem-for-us-why-pak-wants-to-host-us-iran-peace-talks/articleshow/129867059.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/saudi-pact-becoming-a-problem-for-us-why-pak-wants-to-host-us-iran-peace-talks/articleshow/129867059.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T20:36:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129867367,imgsize-103932.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Millions angry with Trump expected to fill American streets]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129867311.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Massive nationwide protests against US President Donald Trump are expected Saturday as millions of people vent fury over what they see as his authoritarian bent and other forms of cruel, law-trampling governance. Several million people turned out, from New York to San Francisco and many places in between.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/millions-angry-with-trump-expected-to-fill-american-streets/articleshow/129867311.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/millions-angry-with-trump-expected-to-fill-american-streets/articleshow/129867311.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-28T20:32:30+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129867641,imgsize-527022.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[JD Vance says he’s 'obsessed' with UFOs, believes aliens are actually demons]]></title><descript